{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your home has been sucked into the <strong>sky</strong> for some reason, ascend a <strong>tower of broken cityscape</strong> to get back. Watch out for the various <strong>obstacles</strong> that stand before you, and <strong>try not fall...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Hop to it!' is a <strong>Foddian-style 3D platformer</strong> where you play as a sentient <strong>pogo-stick</strong>, get to the top to return to your <strong>beloved home</strong> that may or may not be a garden shed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/Gif_01.gif?t=1748026083\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Groundbreaking sentient <strong>pogo stick physics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Serene city views</strong> as you plumet to the ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Helpful tips</strong> to let you know what you could <strong>improve</strong> on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Challenging</strong> but <strong>rewarding movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Several <strong>areas</strong> with <strong>unique challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Checkpoint mode</strong> for practice</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hop (and fall) through various environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/GIF_Envs.gif?t=1748026083\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684340?t=1748026083","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684340?t=1748026083","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/7f4c7807b7eec9614df8